{"version":1,"content":"<p>2024年7月，AMD在美國洛杉磯舉行的「AMD Tech Day 2024」上，更新了CPU的技術路線圖，首次公開確定了Zen 5系列之後將是Zen 6系列架構。其中針對桌面平台，AMD準備了Olympic Ridge，將繼續沿用現有的AM5平台。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587304.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:24:27.093151+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:11:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.765399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.765399+00:00","content_hash":"a3c4a71f754643510c7b31d2e1b3f39e1d7a74320365c2e8da543f54807598e4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}